WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.130
Radio waves, visible light and
X-rays sound like completely

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.430
different things.

3
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.430
But they are all the
same kind of wave.

4
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.730
In space, they all travel
at exactly the same speed.

5
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.130
Yet we are surrounded by radio
waves all day without a second

6
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:19.330
thought, while the person taking
your X-ray steps out of the

7
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.270
room.

8
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.190
So what makes some of
these waves dangerous?

9
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.750
In this mission, you'll put
the seven regions of the

10
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.670
electromagnetic spectrum in order,

11
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.890
and see what they all have in common.

12
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.550
You'll find out what
each one is used for,

13
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.930
and the risks some of them bring.

14
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:39.140
Your mission: find out what makes
some of these waves dangerous.
